==Battleground==
*8 [[Doge]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*8 [[Snache]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 8.33~15 seconds<sup>250f~450f</sup>.
*8 [[Croco]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 8~13.33 seconds<sup>240f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 16.67~26.67 seconds<sup>500f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Nazousagi (Enemy)|Nazousagis]] spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

